# Custom Rules for the YouCloud Project

## Git Push Release Notes Generation

When the user asks to push/send the project to Git, you must immediately write out the new changes in the following formats, incrementing the version accordingly (e.g. from v2.1 to v2.2):

### 1. GitHub Release Notes Format (English & Russian)

# YouCloud v[Version] Release

[Short exciting summary of the release in English]

## 🚀 What's New
* **[Feature Name in English]**: [Brief description of what was changed/added in English]
...

---

# YouCloud v[Version] — [Main feature names in Russian]

## 🚀 Нововведения
* **[Feature Name in Russian]**: [Brief description of what was changed/added in Russian]
...

### 2. Telegram Post Format (Russian)

🎵 YouCloud — Версия [Version]

Что нового:
✨ [Highlight 1]: [Description in Russian]
🎨 [Highlight 2]: [Description in Russian]
...
